LIBRARY Tc2_System
NAMESPACE Tc2_System
RESOLUTION Tc2_System, 3.10.1.0 (Beckhoff Automation GmbH)
PLACEHOLDER true
DEPENDENCIES Tc2_Standard, Tc3_Module
